      "cooked": "<p>As a long time Sentinels of the Multiverse player, I think a League of Dungeoneers type superhero boardgame would be amazing. I recently played league of dungeoneers and I felt like if Greater Than Games came out with a boardgame like that for Sentinels… I would buy it 10 times over. They already have the history, villains, minions, lore, powers, heroes for if you choose to not create all 4 or 5 of them, and a character creation system for the pc’s. Am I right or am I totally off base here? I would just like to know what everyone else thinks. Thanks!</p>",
